      "text": "OLUBADAN CORONATION TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nAs Ibadan prepares for the coronation of the 44th Olubadan of Ibadanland, His Royal Majesty Oba Rashidi Ladoja, on Friday, 26 September 2025, certain roads around Mapo Hall will be closed from 7:00 a.m.\n\nThe routes include Beere Junction inward Mapo Hall; Born Photo Junction inward Oja’ba; Idi-Arere Junction inward Oja’ba; and Itamerin Junction inward Mapo Hall.\n\nGuests are advised to use the designated parking areas:\n\n1. Ibadan North LG Car Park, Agodi (in front of the Immigration Office).\n2. The Football Field beside Yemetu Police Station.\n3. Liberty Stadium, Oke Ado.\n\nShuttle buses will convey invited guests from the designated parking areas to Mapo Hall.\nKindly plan your movement accordingly.",
