      "text": "‼️WEEK OF ACTION AT THE UN GENERAL ASSEMBLY‼️🌍🇵🇸\n\nFrom Palestine to the Philippines, from Sudan to Congo, our struggle is one. This week we rise for collective liberation and to build power against a world that normalizes genocide in Gaza. Bring your flags, your signs, your noisemakers, and your courage. Hold down the space, confront the delegates, and demand to know what they’re doing to stop the genocide in Gaza. There can be no business as usual while a genocide continues to unfold. \n\nWednesday, September 24\n4:00 PM: BK Jail Support on the Link between the IOF, NYPD & Cop Cities\n\nThursday, September 25\n3:00 PM Teach in + March: Bahain NG Protesta! Starting at Bryant Park\n\n5:30 PM Rally: Bahain NG Protesta! | Consulate general of the Philippines\n\nALL DAY RALLY: No Rest for the Wicked! All Our Struggles are Connected\n\nFriday, September 26\n9:00 AM: Doctors Against Genocide - Gaza’s hospitals are taking their last breath. \n\nALL DAY RALLY: Against \"Israel\" and the United Kingdom",
